							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							So whose going to New Orleans for the EQFF?<br /><br />October 28-30<br /><br />Also there is a vampires ball that weekend.<br /><br /><br />-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br />I will be there, I have already made my reservations, just waiting on<br />registration sign ups <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> <br /><br />Killy <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/badhairday.gif" alt="badhairday" border="0" />
